// touching the Phase 1 tab wrote THESE values over the generator's, so
// an unedited "Save" silently moved the tunnel from IKEv2 main mode to
// IKEv1 aggressive mode with SHA-1 - a downgrade nothing reported and
// the dialog itself did not show, because it was displaying the values
// it was about to write, not the ones in force.
